      {
        "key": "uzh-7-23-r1:c3",
        "title": "Yer solig‘i",
        "body": "Ziroatchilar yer solig‘i kalon deb berilgan. Ushbu mavzuning soliq atamasini oldingi asrlarda ishlatilgan barcha nom va stavkalar bilan avtomatik tenglashtirmang.",
        "fact_ids": [
          "uzh-7-topic-23:kalon"
        ],
        "source_refs": [
